for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) if (s.charAt(i) == target) acc++;
return acc;

The following needs a careful answer. Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {4, 5, 9, 12, 14, 17, 18, 19};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 22) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 22) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

